<title>JAPAN: Katokichi -Dec/Mar group forecast.</title>
<headline>Katokichi -Dec/Mar group forecast.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four months to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>		   (in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p>			   LATEST	    ACTUAL</p>
<p> (Group)		FORECAST	  YEAR-AGO</p>
<p> Sales		 59.00	     176.80</p>
<p> Current		3.10		 8.81</p>
<p> Net		  700    million	   2.42</p>
<p> EPS		   12.55 yen	  43.48 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Katokichi Co Ltd is a frozen food producer. The</p>
<p>latest forecasts were for the four-month period ending March</p>
<p>31, 1997, because the company changed its business term.</p>
<p>The year-ago results were for the full year to November</p>
<p>30, 1996.</p>
</text>
